\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Dollar at 500 pesos\b0\par\par\uc2 580 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Juli 2023\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 In contrast to the historic gain of the Mexican super \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  under the administration of President \uc2 Andr\u233\'00\'E9s Manuel L\u243\'00\'F3pez Obrador\uc2 , we can see that in the south of the continent they are no longer feeling the hard way, but the hard way. In view of the delay of an agreement with the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  and the almost null firepower of its \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso broke the barrier of 500 units per dollar yesterday in the informal exchange round. We are reminded that when \uc2 Alberto Fernandez\uc2 's government started the parity was at 60 Argentine pesos, that is, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is already worth a small fraction than at the end of 2019. With inflation at over 100% and just one month away from the primary elections to determine the candidacies in national positions for the presidential and legislative elections of October 2023, they explain to us that the problem is not that Argentina lacks dollars, but that there is a furious excess of pesos.\par \par \uc2 The sabotage continuesWe are told that there is no end to the sabotage between the two most important telecommunications companies in Mexico. So much so that, in the ring, the company that seemed to be on the side of the technicians became rude just like its main competitor. We are told that users have already detected that when Telmex's Infinitum service starts to fail, it is certain that, in the following days, the same thing will happen with Izzi, which is managed until August by Jose Antonio Gonzalez Anaya. We are told that everyone knows that it is the same workers of both companies who cut the cables to cause the interruption of the Internet service and, incidentally, the landline and cable TV service, and no one stops them.\par \par \uc2 There is a Mexican Jetta for a whileDespite the fact that several automakers have decided to stop manufacturing vehicles that sell well in the Mexican market, such as the Aveo, and instead bring them from China, we are informed that \uc2 Volkswagen\uc2 , headed by Holger Nestler, plans to continue manufacturing the Jetta model at the Puebla plant. We are assured that \uc2 Volkswagen de M\u233\'00\'E9xico\uc2  is not considering importing this model, which is, in fact, the car with the highest historical production volume for the German company in the country, with more than 6 million units made by Mexican hands. So there is a Jetta for a while in the domestic market. We are told that Chinese brands no longer only manufacture for North American or European assemblers, but now export to the country vehicles of their own brands such as Chirey, Omoda, Jetour, MG and JAC, whose sales have multiplied over the last few years.\par \par \uc2 20 years financing car purchasesWe are informed that this week, Nissan Mexicana's finance company, Credi Nissan, headed by Andr\u233\'00\'E9 Medeiros, is celebrating 20 years of \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 . In these two decades, the finance company has served 3 million drivers, placing it in first place in the automotive credit sector. The company offers financial options for entrepreneurs, companies that require fleets, SMEs, people who cannot prove income, leasing for corporations and students who want to buy their first vehicle, among others. They tell us that now, the company's focus is to make its credit process 100% digital. It currently has a portfolio of 441 thousand active contracts and the most financed cars are NP300, Versa and Sentra.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020230714ej7d001qd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
