\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 An agreement that is being discussed until the last minute due to the use of dollars\b0\par\par\uc2 897 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Juli 2023\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 Leandro Gabin\par \par \uc2 eleconomista.com.ar\par \par \uc2 "The Fund and Argentina are like those marriages that are cheating on each other and they both know it. But they are still together because neither of them would like to separate". That is the definition that the Government has of its relationship with the organization at the gates of a new agreement that Sergio Massa (with his traditional effervescence) said was "imminent" and would be known in a matter of hours.\par \par \uc2 The truth is that one of the points to be deciphered in the new understanding, which will be until the next government takes office, is the use of dollars to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange market and whether or not there will be an advance of funds. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves are negative and it is believed in the market that \uc2 Miguel Pesce\b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  using (even) the bank reserve requirements in dollars (as stated by the opposition economist Luciano Laspina).\par \par \uc2 The desperation of the economic team to reach the PASO and afterwards, consists in just that: how to avoid a devaluation of the official exchange rate or a jump of the alternative dollar.\par \par \uc2 Some voices in Washington indicate that even part of the delay of the agreement between Massa and the Fund has to do with the use of dollars. The minister and now the only candidate of the Kirchnerist party had been asking that the new agreement should contemplate that Argentina should use foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to control the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 IMF\uc2  does not want to be tied to that (something that would violate its own statute) but neither does it want an implosion of the country.\par \par \uc2 As they say in Casa Rosada, fights of a married couple that lives deceiving each other. The truth is that the new understanding does not seem to have anything outstanding beyond incorporating the fact that Argentina failed to meet all the goals due to the drought.\par \par \uc2 Disbursements and measures\par \par \uc2 Will there be money up front? Anker Latinoam\u233\'00\'E9rica, Luis "Toto" Caputo's consulting firm, says that Massa's candidacy "reinforces the view that the chances of the \uc2 IMF\uc2  validating a relevant disbursement advance without demanding measures in exchange (particularly regarding the exchange rate) are very low".\par \par \uc2 "On the one hand, it would be even more difficult for the organization to advance funds without demands to the candidate of the ruling coalition, given the political implications that this could entail. On the other hand, given that the current minister could be the President with whom the \uc2 IMF\uc2  would have to negotiate as of December, there would be no technical reason to justify the postponement of measures aimed at macroeconomic order", states Anker.\par \par \uc2 Alejandro Werner\uc2 , former \uc2 IMF\uc2 , agrees with this view: "It is unlikely that the program will have significant additional resources for \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be able to use them to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market".\par \par \uc2 The former official of the organization believes that if there are any, they will be few because the \uc2 IMF\uc2  knows that it is lending them to a program that does not make sense and also because they will be used for electoral purposes. "Besides, he knows that between December and February he will have to negotiate with a new government that will probably also ask for new resources", said the Mexican who has always catalogued as a "bad agreement" what was signed between \uc2 Alberto Fern\u225\'00\'E1ndez\uc2  and the organization.\par \par \uc2 For Werner, what will be seen will be an agreement with very low demands from the Fund, given that the current Government is ending its term and does not have the margin to face a comprehensive program that includes a reform package to sustain it. In any case, the outcome of the Massa-\uc2 IMF\uc2  affair remains to be seen.\par \par \uc2 Confidence for what is to come\par \par \uc2 For the time being, there is some hope in the private sector that the coming economy will be better. From the foreign bankers grouped in ABA, they said that "the challenging context we are going through in 2023 should be, at the same time, the kick-off for the long-awaited take-off of our country in 2024".\par \par \uc2 "Even in the midst of the macroeconomic instability resulting from the fiscal imbalance, the scarcity of international reserves, the strong commitments assumed with multilateral credit organizations and the drought that affected the main productive sector, it is possible to glimpse the mechanisms for the recovery of the activity, the creation of formal employment and a strategic insertion in the world, for which -as expressed by the economic swords of most of the candidates-, an economic or stabilization plan of the macroeconomic variables is required", requested the bankers whose visible face is Claudio Cesario.\par \par \uc2 Carlos Melconian, who recently presented his team and economic program of the Fundaci\u243\'00\'F3n Mediterr\u225\'00\'E1nea (for the use of the candidates) said, in his own way, something similar. "I see a lot of light for next year. Soybean, gas, lithium...everything is going for the better", he pointed out.\par \par \uc2 But, true to his style, he clarified: "Let's not be fooled either. Are those who are coming the cow tied up? Never say that in Argentina. But we will be better off if we do things right".\par \par \uc2 The country that was not. The country that will be?\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020230703ej73004tk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
