\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Imports: USD 512 million in yuan paid this year and expected to accelerate in coming months\b0\par\par\uc2 1,418 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Juni 2023\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 As a result of the window opened to pay imports with yuans in the midst of the scarcity of reserves, so far this year Argentina has paid more than USD 500 million of purchases of inputs directly to China with that \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and has committed to use, in terms ranging from 30 to 90 days, about USD 2,400 million more.\par \par \uc2 According to official information, throughout the year, the equivalent of some USD 512 million of imports were paid directly in renminbi \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and almost USD 800 million since 2020. The figure is clearly low compared to the rhythm of imports from China every month, but there are two elements that mark the official dispatches as a trend: firstly, that in the last weeks there has been an acceleration that they qualified as "exponential". As an example: the first two weeks of June have doubled the figure for the whole of May.\par \par \uc2 Secondly, as the yuan payment scheme progresses and consolidates, this number will find a monthly floor of \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  much higher than the current one. According to the latest figures of the Secretariat of Commerce, the SIRAs authorized for companies seeking to import paying with Chinese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  exceeded an amount equivalent to USD 2.4 billion.\par \par \uc2 Although these authorizations will be activated as these waiting periods are met, the Government has already committed to importers half of the first tranche of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange with the Chinese People's Bank, which was for an amount equivalent to USD 5 billion.\par \par \uc2 There are maximum hypotheses circulating in official offices, with the numbers of commercial exchange with China in hand. So far this year, monthly imports from China have been between USD 920 million and USD 1,100 million.\par \par \uc2 A first objective set by the Ministry of Economy had been to be able to pay between 700 and 800 million dollars of these imports directly with Chinese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . An official with direct incidence in the authorizations points out that, if the scheme were sufficiently oiled in the next months, the Government could be able to pay all purchases from China with the Chinese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 According to official data, there are some sectors that have a special preponderance in foreign trade with China and have started to look for a mechanism to pay for their purchases of inputs with yuan. Nearly one third of the authorized requests belong to the electronics sector, which has an industrial pole in Tierra del Fuego and imports its main inputs from Asia.\par \par \uc2 With disaggregated data up to the end of May, the electronics sector concentrated an equivalent of USD 762 million of import payment authorizations in yuan, followed by electrical equipment (USD 304 million), general-purpose machinery (USD 222 million) and chemical products (USD 201 million).\par \par \uc2 With the acceleration of the use of yuan for the payment of imports, the renminbi futures market, a segment of the Rofex - the derivatives market that concentrates approximately 90% of the volume traded in dollar futures in Argentina - in which agents, importers and financial entities that have \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Chinese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  participate, re-emerged, albeit timidly.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  that the BCRA has been carrying out are key to develop this market and are aimed at offering \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  risk hedging to local importers that operate in that \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . RMB yuan futures contracts are traded in Argentine pesos and are settled through daily differences in pesos, so they do not imply the transfer of yuan between the parties", official sources indicated.\par \par \uc2 According to Rofex data, there is an open interest in the renminbi futures market equivalent to some 123 million dollars, which would imply almost 900 million yuan. This is a figure, of course, much lower than the amount of dollar futures traded daily.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  that the BCRA has been carrying out are key to develop this market and are aimed at offering exchange risk coverage to local importers that operate in that \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ", the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  assured.\par \par \uc2 The Government offered as a carrot to importers, in order to tempt them with the possibility of paying for these purchases with renminbi, that the terms in which the access to foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at official prices is approved is shorter, since while those \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  made with US dollars take an average of 180 days from the approval until the importer actually has access to the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in the case of payment with yuans it is 90 days, and according to the Executive Power, shorter terms for SMEs.\par \par \uc2 The acceleration in the use of this tool for the payment of purchases abroad and the marked shortage of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  forced the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to seek an extension -within the limits of the current swap amount, over USD 18 billion- of the use for foreign trade. That was one of the main objectives of the economic team's mission to China last week, which ended with a consensus to add another USD 5 billion for that purpose.\par \par \uc2 What the BCRA said on the subject.\par \par \uc2 "The availability of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap with the \uc2 People's Bank of China\uc2  allowed a growth in commercial \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  conducted in local \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , reaching payments for CNY 3,650 million in the course of the year. Since April, SIRAs in yuan were authorized for an equivalent of US$ 2.9 billion, which will enter the market 90 days after being issued, on average", informed the monetary entity.\par \par \uc2 "The use of yuan in trade was CNY 1,075 million in May and CNY 2,045 million in the first ten rounds of June, showing the rapid acceptance among economic agents."\par \par \uc2 In parallel to the use in trading, "the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BCRA) has been actively \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  since October 2020, promoting the RMB yuan futures market, which is gaining depth and development in the country. The higher volume of \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  that has been registered in the last months, added to the interest shown by agents, financial entities and companies for this instrument, promise to accelerate the development of the RMB yuan futures market."\par \par \uc2 "Also, the BCRA may carry out \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  in yuan for financial stability purposes. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the Argentine Republic\uc2  has its own holdings of yuan, in addition to the CNY 35 billion freely available from the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap for a global amount of CNY 130 billion renewed this month", he specified.\par \par \uc2 "As part of the agreements, the process of extending the special activation for an amount of up to 35 billion yuan renminbi was initiated, which will be released in favor of the BCRA as the use of the first 35 billion is completed and as the financial and reserve strengthening needs require it", he indicated.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  that the BCRA has been carrying out are key to develop both the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and the futures market, where \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  risk hedging is offered to local importers that operate in that \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . RMB yuan futures contracts are traded in Argentine pesos and are settled through daily differences in pesos, so they do not imply the transfer of yuan between the parties."\par \par \uc2 "The active participation of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the Argentine Republic\uc2  is in line with the meetings that the president, \uc2 Miguel \u193\'00\'C1ngel Pesce\uc2 , held in China with representatives of financial entities based in Beijing, where they discussed the need to develop in the Argentine capital market spot and futures \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  in RMB yuan and in which the BCRA committed itself to support the development of such market."\par \par \uc2 "Also in that sense, and with the specific purpose of disseminating the \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  of import payments with yuan, the BCRA organized in May a virtual meeting with the participation of agencies, entities and different foreign trade referents. Most of the \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  are carried out in the Matba Rofex, the derivatives market that concentrates approximately 90% of the volume traded in yuan futures in Argentina", he concluded.\par \par \uc2 After the swap, the Government will once again tender debt to renew 1.2 trillion pesos per month until the PASO (the Presidential Elections).\par \par \uc2 The payment of the half Christmas bonus adds more pressure to a free dollar that is once again close to 500 pesos.\par \par \uc2 How much inflation will rise to in 2024 according to Domingo Cavallo and which country he asked to imitate to control it\par \par \uc2 How much will the dollar and inflation reach by the end of the year, according to the projections of consulting firms\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020230615ej6f00bm1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
