\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 New obstacles for importers: the government "steps on every dollar" and stretches deadlines to the limit\b0\par\par\uc2 576 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Mai 2023\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  regulations to modify the terms from which companies that were exempted from the procedures that until now affected most of the imports become part of the general regime.\par \par \uc2 Until now, there was a universe of products -health industry, pharmaceuticals, those affected by the fight against Covid 19 and even capital goods- that submitted an affidavit informing of their exemption.\par \par \uc2 But the limitations and eventual extensions in the terms for payment abroad are not limited only to those basic inputs of Covid, medical products and medicines or inputs of the pharmaceutical industry.\par \par \uc2 This is established in the new communication A 7766 of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dated Thursday, May 11, which explains in its point 1 that "in order to give access to the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market within the framework of the provisions of points 8.1. to 8.6. of Communication 'A' 7622 and complementary communications, in order to make payments with pending customs entry record for transactions supported by SIRA declarations officialized as from May 12, the entities must additionally verify that the corresponding SIRA declaration in 'OUTGOING' status has been assigned a term of 0 (zero) calendar days".\par \par \uc2 An exploration of the details of the exceptions referred to (points 8.1 to 8.6 of communication "A" 7622) shows that in addition to the health industry, petroleum products and inputs for the production of fuels are also affected.\par \par \uc2 In the paroxysm of the regulation, the impact even reaches construction materials used in public works, such as the necessary and promoted N\u233\'00\'E9stor Kirchner Gas Pipeline. Zero days to access the market and cancel the goods.\par \par \uc2 While before the regulation, the presentation of a sworn statement justifying the exception enabled them to automatically enter the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market -even when the regulation established that the product had to wait between 60 and 90 days- now the SIRA must specifically state "0 (zero) days".\par \par \uc2 "Now those SIRAs have to say 0 (zero) days to be able to close exchange. This generated that not a single payment of this type of goods has been made", an operator of the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market explained to iProfesional.\par \par \uc2 "What until yesterday were exceptions, today they are paid on the date set by the Secretariat of Commerce, like any other cargo", confirmed the Chamber of Importers.\par \par \uc2 If the answer given by the agency is "0 (zero) days", it means that the company can access the market and cancel the goods whenever it wants, even before customs clearance (nationalization or entry of the product). On the other hand, if they say 30, 60, 90 or 120 days, it is necessary to wait that term -from the customs clearance- for the transfer.\par \par \uc2 That is to say, from the moment an order is placed abroad, and that company starts to manufacture it (with the time it takes, but in the case of capital goods it may take several months), dispatches it, ships it and arrives in Argentina, it may take another 60 to 90 days to be able to remit payment, according to a "trickle-down" criterion of the Secretariat of Commerce.\par \par \uc2 In a new confession of the discretionality that will mark the payment terms for products that were "exempted", the Government is stepping on every dollar it can, stretching the terms to the maximum.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020230513ej5d002rx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
