\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Schiaretti on the campaign trail: "If we do not put together a coalition that overcomes the rift, Milei is likely to grow".\b0\par\par\uc2 Redacci\u243\'00\'F3n LAVOZ \par \uc2 808 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Mai 2023\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 Already launched as a pre-candidate for president to compete in the next Paso 2023 elections in Argentina, the governor of C\u243\'00\'F3rdoba, Juan Schiaretti began a tour of the local media where he ratifies the main guidelines on which his campaign will be based from this province.\par \par \uc2 After reiterating that he will be a candidate "against the rift", he said that the coalition he intends to lead together with other national leaders and political referents of the country "has nothing to do with Kirchnerism".\par \par \uc2 "Kirchnerism always wanted to colonize C\u243\'00\'F3rdoba but it could not do it, and it will not do it either", he assured in a dialogue with Cadena 3. "Argentina has always been centralist, there is a view of the country from Amba. Our space will try to express the position of those who work, those who produce, the productive interior", he added.\par \par \uc2 And then he listed the axes on which Argentina should work: "The first thing is to recover the institutional functioning of Argentina, stop persecuting and denigrating those who do not think like you do, as in the case of the Supreme Court or the media".\par \par \uc2 "Then we have to dedicate ourselves to a serious economic stabilization, not patches on patches that are a resounding failure, Kirchernism has been failing since this government started", said Schiaretti.\par \par \uc2 And then he showed his concern for the inflationary indexes: "I vote so that we do not have an inflationary flash, because of the impact on the people, I hope we do not have one that deteriorates people's lives even more. But I also do not see any actions taken by the national government to lower inflation".\par \par \uc2 "We have to seriously attack the fiscal deficit in Argentina, from all angles, without this meaning a wild adjustment", he added.\par \par \uc2 Schiaretti on his government's self-criticismWhen asked about the self-criticism he can make regarding his administration, the governor mentioned, "We have had mistakes, of course, but every time we recognize it, we act accordingly, we try to solve them".\par \par \uc2 "To point out mistakes there is the opposition, we as a government are obliged to solve them," he said.\par \par \uc2 "I was never arbitrary and if I ever was I apologize to the person who may consider it so. I have made mistakes, surely but they have never been in bad faith. I will be a circumstance in the political life in C\u243\'00\'F3rdoba", said Schiarreti.\par \par \uc2 And he added: "I never believed it, I did not flaunt it, I am the same boy from Talleres Oeste who walked around that neighborhood when I was a kid," he said.\par \par \uc2 "I regret having smoked", he finished.\par \par \uc2 Schiaretti on the fight against drugsThe governor and pre-candidate also pronounced himself in favor of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of federal forces to fight the drug advance in \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "There must be border control, more participation of federal forces in the fight and control over the funds managed by those involved in drug organizations," he added.\par \par \uc2 And he said that another way is to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the neighborhood organizations to prevent the drug traffickers "from taking over those sectors".\par \par \uc2 Schiaretti on the public employees' bargaining agreementsThe governor also referred to the delays that were generated in the negotiations with public employees, both with teachers and with the health sector: "This is absolutely logical, because we have a galloping inflation and that is what has caused us to take so long to reach an agreement. In the current situation we have with prices, it is very difficult to make long-term plans".\par \par \uc2 Schiaretti expressed his opinion on the impact of Javier Milei's candidacyThe pre-candidate for President for the next Paso elections expressed his opinion on Javier Milei's candidacy: "It is the expression of the rejection to the political class. If those of us who think about work are not capable of putting together a political coalition leaving aside those who are inside the rift, both in Kirchnerism and in Juntos por el Cambio, it is likely that Milei's figure will continue to grow".\par \par \uc2 And about this candidate's proposal to dollarize the economy, he added: "Dollarization is a miraculous measure without any kind of support. The country needs a stable \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , independence of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and fiscal measures".\par \par \uc2 Schiaretti on Mart\u237\'00\'EDn LlaryoraRegarding the gubernatorial candidate who aspires to succeed him in office for the coalition Hacemos Unidos por C\u243\'00\'F3rdoba, Mart\u237\'00\'EDn Llaryora, Schiaretti showed his support and explained the reasons: "I think he is the person who has shown youth and experience in management quality. He gives certainty and seriousness, he is capable of maintaining all the good things and improving what needs to be done".\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020230505ej5500auq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
