bove represents the Group's maximum exposure to credit risk for such borrowings and accounts receivable.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 32.3 Financial risk management objectives\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The treasury function offers services to business, coordinates access to domestic and international financial markets, monitors and manages the financial risks related to the Group's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  through internal risk reports, which analyze\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 F-62\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Table of Contents\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 LOMA NEGRA COMPA\u209\'00\'D1\u205\'00\'CDA INDUSTRIAL ARGENTINA SOCIEDAD AN\u211\'00\'D3NIMA\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS FOR THE YEARS ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022, 2021 AND 2020\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (figures expressed in thousands of pesos - $ - except as otherwise stated)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 exposures depending on the degree and extent thereof. These risks include market risk (including \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  risk, interest rate at fair value and price risk), credit risk and liquidity risk. The Company and its subsidiaries do not employ or traded derivative financial instruments for speculative purposes. Monitoring compliance with these provisions policy is made by the executive committee and the internal audit team.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 32.4 \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  risk management\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Group carries out transactions in foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ; and is hence exposed to exchange rate fluctuations. Exposures in the exchange rate are managed within approved policy parameters using \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  contracts.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The carrying amounts of monetary assets and liabilities denominated in foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2