\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Financial day: the Argentine stock market was isolated from Wall Street's rebound and deepened its downward slide\b0\par\par\uc2 1,164 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2023\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 Finally, inflation in Argentina exceeded 100% again after more than three decades. INDEC reported that February CPI reached 6.6%, with an increase of 102.5% compared to the same month of 2022. This bad "macro" data was associated with a response from the financial side, with the fourth downward session for stocks and the seventh negative session for the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which continues to sell liquid reserves in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 Although foreign markets showed a rebound after the collapse of the last rounds, due to the banking crisis that forced the \uc2 US government\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to protect depositors, the improvement did not extend to \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 , where the relaxation of the goals of the agreement with the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2 , far from clearing the financial horizon, awakened investors' concern. It is clear that the Government will not seek to balance the public accounts or strengthen the reserves for the remainder of the term. Therefore, there will be more inflation and deterioration of the economy in an already unstable year due to the presidential elections.\par \par \uc2 The leading benchmark S&P Merval in Buenos Aires climbed more than 3% in the morning. However, at the close it fell 2.1% to 220,447 points. The panel of leading stocks has thus recorded a loss of 12.2% in pesos -and 15% in dollars "contado con liqui"- in four consecutive downward rounds. In 2023, the Merval retains a gain of 9.1% in pesos, below inflation, and in dollars, a loss of 4.1%.\par \par \uc2 !function(e,i,n,s)\{var t="InfogramEmbeds",d=e.getElementsByTagName("script")[0];if(window[t]&&window[t].initialized)window[t].process&&&window[t].process();else if(!e.getElementById(n))\{var o=e.createElement("script");o.async=1,o.id=n,o.src="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://e.infogram.com/js/dist/embed-loader-min.js",d.parentNode.insertBefore(o,d)}}}(document,0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://e.infogram.com/js/dist/embed-loader-min.js",d.parentNode.insertBefore(o,d)\}\}\}(document,0}}}\uc2 , "infogram-async");\par \par \uc2 Argentine ADRs and stocks on Wall Street turned mostly negative. \uc2 YPF\uc2  fell 1.3 percent to USD 9.78, and Grupo Galicia dropped 2.3 percent. The state-owned oil company was particularly hit by the 4.4% drop in the international price of crude oil, to USD 71.54 a barrel in Texas.\par \par \uc2 On the New York stock exchanges, the Dow Jones index rose 1.1%, and the technological Nasdaq rose 2.1%, after it was announced that February inflation in the US was 0.4%, in line with analysts' expectations.\par \par \uc2 Emiliano Anselmi, Chief Economist at Portfolio Personal Inversiones, said: "It would seem that there is more calm, after the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  encapsulated the problem and prevented it from spreading beyond \uc2 Silicon Valley Bank\uc2 . On the other hand, within this context, the possibility is also being priced in that the Fed may not dare to raise rates by 50 basis points and may end up raising them by 25 basis points or even leave them unchanged. If this were to happen -and if a flight to quality phenomenon does not occur-, it would be something that would be very good for emerging markets and would take pressure off Argentine bonds, which are with a weighted average parity of USD 27.4, from the USD 35 they were able to reach in January".\par \par \uc2 "Clearly, it is difficult for local bonds to have a big rally in the short term. Even if we were to have an electoral trade, it would be with less intensity than in 2015, because the reality is that that memory is still fresh and it was not the best. Today it takes more than expectations. External investors have not had a good time with Argentina several times and are quite more disbelieving. Also because the macro starting points are more challenging than before: from inflation, to the stagnation of economic activity and other drivers. We can say that very challenging adjustments are required," Anselmi added.\par \par \uc2 !function(e,i,n,s)\{var t="InfogramEmbeds",d=e.getElementsByTagName("script")[0];if(window[t]&&window[t].initialized)window[t].process&&&window[t].process();else if(!e.getElementById(n))\{var o=e.createElement("script");o.async=1,o.id=n,o.src="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://e.infogram.com/js/dist/embed-loader-min.js",d.parentNode.insertBefore(o,d)}}}(document,0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://e.infogram.com/js/dist/embed-loader-min.js",d.parentNode.insertBefore(o,d)\}\}\}(document,0}}}\uc2 , "infogram-async");\par \par \uc2 Gustavo Ber, an economist at Estudio Ber, added that "beyond the political noise and local economic challenges, ADRs and dollar bonds have been showing a high correlation with respect to the adverse external climate, since they are hostage to global risk appetite and its influence on emerging markets".\par \par \uc2 "Thus, bets on a change of regime in the elections have been displaced for the moment, after the anticipated 'electoral trade' of the last months, and instead, global risk aversion has taken over its dynamics at this stage, while the administration -with debt swaps, among others- is trying to mitigate the transition", Ber pointed out.\par \par \uc2 Dollar bonds traded with a gain of 0.4% on average, according to the reference of the swap Globals on Wall Street, while \uc2 JP Morgan\uc2 's country risk fell 30 units to 2,293 basis points at 5:15 pm.\par \par \uc2 Another strong sale by the BCRA\par \par \uc2 One day after the Argentine government reached an agreement with the Monetary Fund to make the reserves target more flexible, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to carry out the largest sale of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the wholesale market so far this month, for about 145 million dollars. This was the seventh consecutive round with a negative balance for the entity.\par \par \uc2 "According to rumors, payments for energy imports and other imports, in the face of a low supply, justified today's official sales", commented Gustavo Quintana, agent of PR Corredores de Cambio.\par \par \uc2 !function(e,i,n,s)\{var t="InfogramEmbeds",d=e.getElementsByTagName("script")[0];if(window[t]&&window[t].initialized)window[t].process&&&window[t].process();else if(!e.getElementById(n))\{var o=e.createElement("script");o.async=1,o.id=n,o.src="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://e.infogram.com/js/dist/embed-loader-min.js",d.parentNode.insertBefore(o,d)}}}(document,0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://e.infogram.com/js/dist/embed-loader-min.js",d.parentNode.insertBefore(o,d)\}\}\}(document,0}}}\uc2 , "infogram-async");\par \par \uc2 The BCRA records in March net sales of USD 556 million in the MULC and in the course of 2023 the negative balance in the MULC reaches USD 1,638 million.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the free dollar ended the month at $377 for sale, maintaining a meager increase of two pesos in March. With the wholesale dollar up 21 cents to $202.07, the exchange rate gap reached 86.6 percent.\par \par \uc2 Markets: Argentina's stock market bounces back on the back of external improvements\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrencies: how Bitcoin and the rest of the crypto market reacted after the closure of \uc2 Silicon Valley Bank\par \par \uc2 U.S. inflation slowed to 6 percent year-on-year in February\par \par \uc2 Dollar live today: the free quote remains at 377 pesos\par \par \uc2 Prices of notebooks and tablets rise: the government increased tariffs to import computers\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020230314ej3e00dtg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
