\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Ricardo L\u243\'00\'F3pez Murphy: "Sergio Massa's time at the Ministry of Economy has been very unfortunate".\b0\par\par\uc2 1,567 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 November 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The economy seems to be Argentina's Achilles heel. No government in recent years has been able to control or at least stabilize problems such as inflation, poverty, unemployment, among other ills. Of course, \uc2 Alberto Fernandez\uc2 's administration was no exception, during his term he has already had three ministers of Economy, the last one, Sergio Massa, who was chosen as a sort of super-powerful to save the Government. Among several measures adopted by Massa, in the last hours the "Fair Prices" program was announced, which consists in freezing the prices of 1,500 products, an idea that Ricardo L\u243\'00\'F3pez Murphy, national congressman, economist and even former minister of the same portfolio, considers "nonsense". L\u243\'00\'F3pez Murphy questioned Massa's "Fair Prices" program\par \par \uc2 The "Fair Prices" program will start this November 12 and will last 120 days. It will freeze 1,500 food, beverage, dairy, personal hygiene and cleaning products. Massa does not like to call it a "freeze", so he explained that it is not a price freeze but "a voluntary agreement between the State, mass consumption companies, wholesale chambers and supermarkets". In this sense, the opposition believes that it will be one more economic program to add to the list of failures of the ruling party, which in the opinion of the opposition does not propose new ideas, but plans that have been failing for "4 thousand years".\par \par \uc2 "That policy has failed 4 thousand years ago, that is, price controls do not work anywhere in the world.... I suppose that the Government keeps repeating this model out of demagogy, they have not been able to apply a more intelligent program, it is incomprehensible, the truth is that it seems to me an unusual thing", said L\u243\'00\'F3pez Murphy in an interview with iProfesional, and added: "These things they do are inexplicable, I am often baffled by these absurdities".\par \par \uc2 Regarding the "Fair Prices" program, it is important to clarify that the government argued its proposal on the understanding that it is currently the only way to achieve price stability in the prices of essential products consumed by Argentine households. As explained by Minister Sergio Massa, products enter the program at a price up to 4% higher than the average price recorded during October 2022 and will remain stable for the next 120 days.\par \par \uc2 In that line, and consulted on Sergio Massa's management regarding the role he assumed a few months ago as head of the Ministry of Economy, Ricardo L\u243\'00\'F3pez Murphy was blunt: "I think that this step of Massa in Economy is very unfortunate, because it reveals that he has not picked up that 4 thousand years teaching", questioned the legislator, who alleged that it is "difficult" to understand how is it that the leader of the Frente Renovador with such a "critical" scenario as the one Argentina has "for example, issuing at 7 or 8% monthly or with debts that can only be paid with issuance, does he think it is a good idea to freeze prices?... If he believes that with these conditions he can freeze prices, it is insane". On the Argentine economy and its "critical" situation\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, the national deputy of the opposition described as "very critical" the current economic situation of the country, and in that line he pondered some variables that make \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  stagnant and without real growth, among them: inflation, market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and BCRA reserves, crisis of confidence and the climate variant.\par \par \uc2 "The first variable is inflation, where we have reached levels close to 100% and we will probably exceed that percentage, there are also the external payments, since we have run out of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and this leads to a critical situation with the private commercial debt for imports.... We also have an extraordinary stress in financing and reserves with respect to the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BCRA)? There are many variables, among them a crisis of confidence very accentuated by the sum of these and other episodes, added to the climatic variant that also influences, since the volume of our exports depends substantially on the weather, then we have reached a state of extreme vulnerability with all this"; sentenced the deputy and former national minister.\par \par \uc2 For L\u243\'00\'F3pez Murphy, the solution "is easy", but there must be political will to be able to carry out a program that will ultimately get Argentina out of the hole it is in. "Argentina has to grow, it is easy: exports, investment, private employment and there has to be no room for deficit. It has to have a significant current account surplus and a comfortable and balanced fiscal situation, because it has no savings, no reserves, no access to credit and a very high vulnerability in terms of credibility, due to its inflationary history, its defaults, and other limitations. It seems to me that there is no doubt about what needs to be done", he described, while adding that it is necessary "a fiscal and monetary arrangement" that allows stabilization and growth. L\u243\'00\'F3pez Murphy: economy, 2023 and internal affairs\par \par \uc2 Regarding the economic future of the country and facing 2023, L\u243\'00\'F3pez Murphy is not too optimistic, and considered that if the Government continues applying wrong policies, the economic future will not be favorable at all. "I would say that if the problems are faced in an intelligent way Argentina will have a valuable way out, but if it makes stupidities or alchemies such as price controls it will go very badly".\par \par \uc2 Regarding the coalition to which he belongs, L\u243\'00\'F3pez Murphy clings to an "overwhelming" triumph of Juntos por el Cambio to be able to put the critical situation of the country on track, and in that line he considered that a change of course after the elections of 2023 is only possible if the opposition remains truly united and not only wins the electoral contest, but must do so with a wide advantage and majority.\par \par \uc2 "If it wins with an overwhelming result JxC has a comprehensive plan, but if it wins without such a result and does not have majorities in the Chambers (Deputies and Senate) the truth I do not know how it is done, because the reforms that need to be made in Argentina are very important, and in a context and crisis of this magnitude if there is no majority you can not govern," warned the national legislator.\par \par \uc2 Juntos por el Cambio is convinced that in 2023 it is going to be Government again, however, L\u243\'00\'F3pez Murphy warned that if the Frente de Todos reapplies in 2023 in the famous "platita plan" to try to win the elections, if JxC assumes it will have a "very complicated" panorama. "That is why we have the inflation we have, imagine what we will have if they apply the plan platita again," he reflected.\par \par \uc2 Regarding the internal opposition, the legislator considered that there is "an excessive internalism in Juntos por el Cambio" and attributed it to the issue of candidacies. "This happens because they anticipate to talk about candidacies and this is not good either, it is necessary to forget about candidacies for now and work on a plan and program, on the rules of the game, this would be very good for the opposition coalition", he considered.\par \par \uc2 Precisely, and talking about candidacies, there is speculation about a possible pre-candidacy of Ricardo L\u243\'00\'F3pez Murphy for the City of Buenos Aires, and when asked about this issue, the economist said: "I have already been a minister and I should not repeat those portfolios, I would do something else? I will probably continue as a congressman or maybe I can be a candidate; that remains open, and at this stage it is reasonable that it is open, I think that by April or May everything will be defined, today it is very premature, we are a year and a bit away from the elections". L\u243\'00\'F3pez Murphy's pillar project\par \par \uc2 Currently, the national legislator is touring some provinces of the country where he is giving lectures on the economic and stabilization program he proposes to put Argentina on the right track, however, in his role as national deputy in the Congress he has presented some 114 projects, the most important one being the Employment Promotion Project.\par \par \uc2 As a matter of fact, in November 2021, the deputy of the United Republicans bloc presented in the lower house a bill that aims to encourage the creation of new jobs through incentives to companies and amendments to the current labor legislation. Among other things, the text proposes: Promote the creation of productive employment through the different actions and instruments contained in the different policies of the national government, discouraging evasive practices; implement mechanisms of tripartite and federal participation at the decision-making level, to promote employment insertion in an adequate manner and through a simplified regime that results in the generation of quality employment, covering large, medium, small and micro companies, among others.\par \par \uc2 In this sense, L\u243\'00\'F3pez Murphy explained that his initiative "has had some progress and discussion in several commissions", and considered that his project is ideal to be applied in Argentina since "we have not created formal employment for many years, and that is what this project solves, it would be vital for our economy to apply it", he closed.\par \par \uc2 The complete project below:\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020221112eibb008a5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
