\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Atypical: the BCRA did not buy or sell dollars in the official market, what does it mean and why did it abstain?\b0\par\par\uc2 523 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Oktober 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BCRA) did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  this Wednesday in the official \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, thus maintaining its negative balance of close to u$s250 million so far this month. This abstention is atypical, since it usually buys or sells dollars in that market. At most, sometimes it ends the day with a neutral result, but it is not common that it does not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  at all. That is why, in the City, some analysts explain the reason for this situation\par \par \uc2 "From what was observed during the trading session, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not participate because there was no need to do so. The market operated with tranquility and relative balance between private supply and demand", says Gustavo Quintana, from PR Operadores de Cambio.\par \par \uc2 According to economist Federico Glustein, this is due to the fact that there was a very low number of \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday and the market was rarely balanced between supply and demand. Dollar: balance in the official market due to SIRA\par \par \uc2 For economist Christian Buteler, "this balance would be the ideal state, that supply and demand are regulated spontaneously and that the BCRA enters the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market only with genuine funds and not with issuance". Thus, he explains that what it should seek in this case is only to dollarize the profit it manages to obtain in a certain period and to buy, to that end, the dollars eventually overbid by traders.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, Glustein explains that today's market equilibrium situation"is quite related to the few authorizations to import" that were issued. It should be recalled that this week the new Import System of the Argentine Republic (SIRA), which replaced the Integrated Import Monitoring System (SIMIs), started operating.\par \par \uc2 The new system foresees that the information registered allows the analysis of the Importer's Economic and Financial Capacity, draws a "Customs and Tax Risk Profile" based on the history of import over-invoicing and abusive use of precautionary measures or presentation of false Affidavits.\par \par \uc2 It also shortened to 60 days the maximum waiting period for the accreditation of dollars for the payment of imports in the case of SMEs and civil entities and the maximum of 180 days is maintained for the rest of the operators and \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 It was established that the import procedure will start with the presentation of a sworn statement before the Federal Administration of Public Revenues (AFIP), which will include a single account, date of money transfer and control and monitoring of the balance in real time. It was established that there will be a single current account for Foreign Trade and the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will grant, from the moment of approval, a transfer date and, on the other hand, the importation will be facilitated for those who wish to import with their own dollars.\par \par \uc2 All this is aimed at having greater control over imports, avoiding abuses and channeling dollars to production as much as possible to protect the BCRA's reserves.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020221019eiaj00bhy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
