\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 How the IDB president, who got the \uc2 IMF\uc2  to give $50 billion to Macri, now blocks $500 million key for Argentina\b0\par\par\uc2 1,229 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Juli 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The President of the \uc2 Inter-American Development Bank\uc2 , Mauricio Claver Carone, is blocking the disbursement of US$ 500 million to Argentina in the midst of the exchange rate crisis. The funds correspond to credits already approved by the organization for the first semester of the year, whose maximum execution date was set for June 30. The delegation that will accompany \uc2 Alberto Fern\u225\'00\'E1ndez\uc2  to the meeting with \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  in the United States, in ten days, hopes that the issue will be resolved earlier so as not to have to include it in the bilateral agenda.\par \par \uc2 The arrival of those 500 million dollars is important to strengthen the reserves of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the midst of the dispute with the devaluation team, which is currently in full activity. The obstacles put by Claver Carone to the accreditation of the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which according to plan should have taken place months ago, and at the most two weeks ago, are decoded in the Government as a signal from the official to the economic, financial and political actors who are pushing for an abrupt jump in the exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 The economic plan that these sectors are seeking to impose is simple: devaluation of 35 to 40 percent, zero fiscal deficit in one year and a sharp rise in interest rates to balance the balance. In this way, the agricultural sector would liquidate the 14 billion dollars it has kept in silobags, speculative maneuvers with imports would decrease, there would be new incentives to save in pesos, the price of bonds and shares would increase and normality would be restored.\par \par \uc2 This is what is postulated by the agricultural corporations that stopped this week, without being able to find a reason to disguise the market coup for which they are militating; local and foreign investment funds; large companies of the Industrial Union -where fights for that position are intensifying-, and most of the economic orthodoxy that is part of Juntos por el Cambio (Together for Change).\par \par \uc2 The consequences of this type of programs are well known in the country: regressive shock in income distribution, violent transfer of wealth in favor of concentrated groups, inflationary explosion, increase in poverty, deterioration of salaries and pensions. In that case, the country would be left to three or four people alive, much more than in the current situation, which clearly demands improvements of all kinds, but still gives the Frente de Todos the possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to make it happen.\par \par \uc2 Claver Carone, from Trump to the IDBIn his recent participation in the Summit of the Americas, the Argentine president raised his voice against U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the IDB. "Regional development banking, without further delay, has to return in its governance to Latin America and the Caribbean. The IDB requires a capitalization process to have more and better means of financing," said Fern\u225\'00\'E1ndez, also on behalf of \uc2 Celac\uc2 , in his capacity as president pro tempore of the regional organization.\par \par \uc2 Claver Carone was elected head of the IDB in September 2020, for a five-year term, due to pressure from the United States. Historically, this position was for a candidate from Latin America and the Caribbean, since the IDB's main function is to finance development in the region. \uc2 Gustavo B\u233\'00\'E9liz\uc2  was going to compete for the position, but the government withdrew the nomination when it became clear that there was no way to beat the man \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  had put forward.\par \par \uc2 Claver Carone is the same one who openly said that the extraordinary \uc2 IMF\uc2  credit to \uc2 Mauricio Macri\uc2 's government was ordered by Trump to support him in his quest for reelection. He admitted it when he was defending himself as a candidate to head the IDB, knowing the case directly, since he had been the U.S. representative to the board of the Monetary Fund when the events took place.\par \par \uc2 Now, from the IDB, the economist is blocking the disbursement of loans to \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 . These are already approved programs that need a last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on his part to make effective the transfer of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But Claver Carone does not do so with the argument that he is being investigated for a series of accusations against him: one for embezzlement of funds and another for "ethical misconduct", according to the institution's codes, for an alleged affair with a directive of the organization.\par \par \uc2 The Argentine government considers that this is an excuse and that the real intention is to complicate the political stability of the Frente de Todos. "He hides the money. It became a diplomatic problem. All deadlines have already expired. The last date that Argentina could tolerate was June 30", they complain in official offices.\par \par \uc2 The run on the devaluationOfficials are angry because at this moment every dollar counts. The financial and exchange scenario is more than delicate, they recognize. The quotation of government bonds that were a reference in the last debt restructuring, such as the AL30D, at 17 dollars, when it was around 50 dollars after the exchange, is a sign that "large investment funds have lowered their thumbs on Argentina". "They are discounting that the bonds are wallpaper and that the country will have to restructure again," they lament.\par \par \uc2 Speculative behaviors tend to multiply in this scenario. The liquidation of exports in the last two weeks was in dribs and drabs. Officials estimate that there are 14 billion dollars stored in silobags, waiting or pressing for a devaluation. "Interest rates are not attractive in the face of the risk of an exchange rate jump. There is no rush to sell. The costs of the next campaign are already covered with what has been sold up to now", claim from agricultural and exporting areas to demand a rise of the official dollar up to 180 or 190 pesos, from the current 135 pesos.\par \par \uc2 As for imports, there are companies that are managing to evade official controls to carry out \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  through the dollar with liquidation, which puts more pressure on the demand in that market and raises the quotation. This Friday it climbed to a record level of 301.50 pesos.\par \par \uc2 The displacement of Adri\u225\'00\'E1n Cosentino from the National Securities Commission (CNV) took place in this context, although it is also part of the readjustments of the economic cabinet due to the resignation of \uc2 Mart\u237\'00\'EDn Guzm\u225\'00\'E1n\uc2 . The appointment of his vice-president, Sebasti\u225\'00\'E1n Negri, as head of the agency came with the instruction to reinforce controls in the financial and exchange markets.\par \par \uc2 Reserves"There is a way out of the crisis. At the end of August the accumulation of reserves should start to be ordered, which is fundamental to regenerate expectations", affirms the economic cabinet. Banks and mutual funds also need to sort out the situation, given their high exposure in Treasury and \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  securities.\par \par \uc2 "The most important thing of all is to assume a stronger institutional position. The three faces of the Frente de Todas have to be united and forceful. Otherwise, there is a climate of transition. Credibility is lost", analyzes an economist of that space.\par \par \uc2 "The solution is political. There is a need for an agreement. But there is still a lot of uncertainty", he remarks. And Batakis knows it.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020220716ei7g0037b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
