at would lengthen payment terms and replace its current stand-by programme.\par \par \uc2 With restricted access to international credit markets and no more international reserves available, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has limited its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in recent weeks.\par \par \uc2 In \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls have been tightening since 2019. Individuals can only legally purchase US$200 dollars a month at the official exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 \u8211\'20\'13 TIMES/AFP\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020220126ei1q00adi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
