\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Argentina \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes \highlight\uc2  to halt peso fall, country risk rises to 1,900 bps\b0\par\par\uc2 574 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 November 2021\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES, Nov 30 (Reuters) - Argentina's peso held its value on Tuesday only thanks to an active action of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BCRA), which through dollar sales managed to balance the wholesale prices of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against a firm private \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hedging for the end of the month.\par \par \uc2 The purchase of dollars is a constant in the South American country despite multiple exchange controls, amid various rumors that brought uneasiness to the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 "The guys at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  went all out to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the single free exchange market (MULC)," said a source familiar with the exchange circuit.\par \par \uc2 Gustavo Quintana, from PR Corredores de Cambio, affirmed that "the BCRA's sales are now accommodating the wholesale dollar rate".\par \par \uc2 Players in the domestic financial market are waiting for the presentation announced by the government of a multi-year economic plan with the guidelines of a long-awaited agreement with the \uc2 IMF\uc2  to restructure debt for 45 billion dollars.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week banned the sale in installments of tickets and tourist services abroad to safeguard its scarce reserves and ordered that from December banks must reduce their Global Net Position (PGN) of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to 0%, which would force banks to get rid of about 600 million dollars.\par \par \uc2 This measure "has no effect" on the deposits of private savers, explained a BCRA source. To provide predictability, private banks went out to import banknotes and in recent hours asked the BCRA about 100 million dollars to supply the alleged demand triggered by false rumors of freezing deposits in dollars, traders said.\par \par \uc2 Investor fears were again reflected in falling bond and stock prices, plus a country risk above 1,900 basis points, an absolute record since a millionaire debt swap in September last year and with current prices considered at 'default' levels.\par \par \uc2 * In the wholesale exchange market, the peso gained an unusual 0.01% to 100.92/100.93 per dollar by 1550 GMT thanks to the BCRA's stance, which accumulated in November sales of about 755 million dollars of its weak reserves to control the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 * The peso gave up 1.2% in November and lost almost 23% in 2021, in the face of annualized inflation slightly above 50%, according to official data. Analysts believe that this exchange rate lag is further complicating the economy.\par \par \uc2 * In this framework of search for dollars, the alternative peso in the stock market "CCL" fell to 214.7 units, fell to 200.3 in the "dollar MEP" and fell to 201.5 per dollar in the informal segment or 'blue'.\par \par \uc2 * Over-the-counter debt fell by an average of 0.4%, after accumulating a drop of almost 5% in the last two weeks. This was evidenced in the country risk of the \uc2 JP Morgan\uc2  bank, which climbed 27 units, to a record high of 1,905 basis points. The figure is far from the 1,082 points with which the index resumed in September of the previous year.\par \par \uc2 * The benchmark S&P; Merval also fell 0.5% to 78,702.8 units, down 6.9% between Friday and Monday.\par \par \uc2 * The global markets remain attentive to the consequences that the omicron variant of the coronavirus could have on the world economy (Report by Jorge Otaola; With the collaboration of Hern\u225\'00\'E1n Nessi; Edited by Nicol\u225\'00\'E1s Misculin).\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020211130ehbu0077b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
