\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 MEP Dollar soars, equals the blue and increases the profit by mashing\b0\par\par\uc2 460 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 November 2021\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The MEP dollar today, Tuesday, November 16, 2021, trades at $ 199.57 for the purchase and $ 199.70 and equals the blue dollar, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchanged in the parallel market.\par \par \uc2 After the more than 7% jump recorded by the \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  resulting from the purchase and sale of bonds driven by the mini \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BCRA), savers begin to see the stock market dollar as one of the channels to mash and get a gross profit of $ 5074.\par \par \uc2 The blue dollar rises again and MEP soars\par \par \uc2 Less firepower: the BCRA, the limit in its position allowed future dollar\par \par \uc2 MEP DOLLAR, HOW MUCH PROFIT DOES MASHING LEAVE TODAY?\par \par \uc2 Making mash or obtaining mash dollar today through the purchase of MEP dollar (exchange rate arising from the purchase and sale of bonds or shares), leaves a net gain of $ 5074 when using the full quota of u$s 200 established by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Argentina\uc2  (BCRA).\par \par \uc2 HOW TO MAKE PUREED DOLLAR WITH MEP DOLLAR\par \par \uc2 In order to make pureed dollar with MEP dollar, you first need $ 34,816, which is the equivalent of u$s 200 at the current official retail price with taxes (solidarity dollar).\par \par \uc2 Then, in the stock market an average of $ 199.57 is paid for each MEP dollar, which results in a final amount of $ 39,914. Consequently, a profit of $ 5098 is obtained.\par \par \uc2 IS IT LEGAL TO MASH DOLLARS?\par \par \uc2 According to the Criminal Exchange Regime Law, it is illegal to buy and sell dollars on the street.\par \par \uc2 The regulation warns that "any exchange negotiation that is carried out without the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of an institution authorized to carry out such \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 ", that is, banks and authorized exchange houses, will be sanctioned.\par \par \uc2 New dollar exchange blockade: what \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  limited and what effect the market expects\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency exchanges are drawing the attention of regulators\par \par \uc2 WHAT HAPPENS IF I OPERATE WITH PUREED DOLLAR\par \par \uc2 The penalty for operating outside the law (mashing with blue dollar or MEP dollar) is a fine of up to 10 times the amount of the transaction if it is the first time.\par \par \uc2 With a repeat offense, the penalty increases from 1 to 4 years in prison or a fine of 3 to 10 times the total.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a second repeat offence carries a penalty of 1 to 8 years imprisonment and the maximum fine in this case is 10 times the amount negotiated.\par \par \uc2 In addition, in all cases, a suspension of up to 10 years or cancellation of the authorization to operate or intermediate in exchange, both to act as an importer, exporter, exchange broker or authorized institutions, may be applied jointly.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020211116ehbg008by\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
