\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange \highlight\uc2  Pressures Increase in Countdown to Midterm Elections\b0\par\par\uc2 737 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 November 2021\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES, Nov 11 (Reuters) - The dollarization of portfolios for hedging continued to pressure the Argentine market on Thursday, a few days before a key legislative election as the officialdom could lose control of Congress if the result of the primaries held in September is repeated.\par \par \uc2 The quotation of the peso against the dollar in the marginal market or 'blue' returned to mark a historic low and the exchange rate gap against the interbank rate exceeded 106.5%.\par \par \uc2 "What we are seeing is a search for hedging by investors, prior to the legislative elections on Sunday. The dynamics of the exchange rate will depend on the government's actions and what tone it decides to take," said Emiliano Anselmi, of Portfolio Personal Inversiones.\par \par \uc2 "If it were to radicalize, it would not be positive. Meanwhile, if it is more moderate and inclined to seek an agreement with the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  (\uc2 IMF\uc2 ), things could calm down and the foam could deflate," he said.\par \par \uc2 In addition to the electoral uncertainty, there are also doubts about the country's economic future, which is going through an economy with high inflation, high monetary emission and the search for an agreement with the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  for a million-dollar debt that has failed to materialize.\par \par \uc2 "The Argentine problem is not so much the type of public policies, but rather the type of consensus that is generated to move towards a comprehensive economic plan, whether it is more centrist, more \b \highlight22\uc2 interventionist\b0 \highlight\uc2  or more market-oriented (...) In \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  we need much more political clarity, more political anchoring and credibility," said Javier Timerman, a partner at the consulting firm AdCap, in a radio interview.\par \par \uc2 The peso traded in the reduced marginal market devalued 0.73% to 203.5/206.5 per dollar, after marking an all-time low of 207 units for sale in the first part of the session, traders said.\par \par \uc2 We know that this is an illegal dollar, which is managed with other expectations," presidential spokeswoman Gabriela Cerruti told a news conference.\par \par \uc2 * For its part, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the interbank strip lost a regulated 0.06% to 100.18/100.21 units under the control of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BCRA).\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to get rid of about 40 million dollars to meet the demand of the market, which accumulates sales of its reserves for about 330 million dollars in the last three rounds, traders said.\par \par \uc2 The holiday today (Thursday) in the United States prevents \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  to settle today abroad, except those arranged to settle from tomorrow (Friday) and those made against own accounts of financial institutions in BCRA," said Gustavo Quintana, operator of PR Corredores de Cambio.\par \par \uc2 The Argentine peso in the alternative markets fell to 183.4 per dollar in the "Contado con Liquidaci\u243\'00\'F3n", to 183.3 in the "d\u243\'00\'F3lar MEP" and to 216 per dollar in the bilateral negotiation "Senebi", where now the BCRA also seeks to influence with the sale of bonds, according to market sources.\par \par \uc2 * The S&P; Merval stock index improved 0.85% to a provisional close of 95,943.83 units, against the intraday record of 97,024.42 units recorded on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The Merval trades in the middle of the 95,000 points and 97,500 points that could act as resistance for the index," said Alexander Londo\u241\'00\'F1o, analyst at ActivTrades.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, bonds in the over-the-counter segment did not show genuine values due to the U.S. inactivity, although the country risk prepared by the bank JP.Morgan soared nine units to a record 1,753 basis points, to exceed the 1,747 points recorded a week ago.\par \par \uc2 It is expected to know the reactions and strategies of the ruling party, as well as the opposition, after the elections, since the viability of advancing with consensus to an agreement with the \uc2 IMF\uc2  and the correction of the accumulated and delayed imbalances will depend on them," said an economist.\par \par \uc2 He added that "otherwise the risks of incubating a new crisis would be accentuated, as well as suffering financial tensions due to the lack of confidence of economic agents.\par \par \uc2 Retail prices rose by 3.5% in October in its national measurement, said the National Institute of Statistics and Censuses (INDEC), a figure higher than expected among analysts.\par \par \uc2 (Report by Walter Bianchi; Additional reporting by Hern\u225\'00\'E1n Nessi; Edited by Jorge Otaola)\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020211111ehbb00bn3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
