\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Free Financial Dollar starts the week above $ 216, just days before the elections\b0\par\par\uc2 890 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 November 2021\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 Since the debt restructuring, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BCRA) has adopted a modality of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the stock exchange market, which consists of selling bonds against pesos and buying them back against dollars.\par \par \uc2 The idea is to keep the implicit prices of AL30 bonds at bay and that this will end up pushing down the rest of the financial dollars.\par \par \uc2 But the results have not been as expected. The BCRA has already spent some u$s 2.5 billion in the repurchase of instruments and the free financial quotes are still not contagious. In fact, in the last few weeks they took off in a forceful way and are already above 216 pesos.\par \par \uc2 Free dollar, through the roof\par \par \uc2 To give an example, the cash with liquidity that is made with shares starts this Monday at $ 217.21, if we take an average of the implicit values in the five most traded papers for this \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Galicia, YPF, Pampa, Macro and Banco Franc\u233\'00\'E9s).\par \par \uc2 This value implies a 4.8% jump compared to the previous Monday.\par \par \uc2 As for Cedear's cash and cash equivalents, also averaging the five most traded papers (\uc2 Coca Cola\uc2 , Tesla, \uc2 Amazon\uc2 , \uc2 Barrick Gold\uc2  and Apple), an implied value of 216.90 pesos is observed.\par \par \uc2 Another of the most followed free quotes is the one that emerges from the Bilateral Trading Segment (Senebi) where big players operate. This Monday, the Senebi dollar was long at $ 216, which implies an advance of $ 6 over the previous week.\par \par \uc2 Just a few steps behind is the CCL value which comes from buying the GD30 bond in local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and settling it abroad in dollars, which is at $ 214.19 in t+2.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, if the GD30 is settled in the local stock market, that is, as a MEP dollar, the price is 205.23 pesos.\par \par \uc2 Although the financial dollars obtained through foreign law bonds were considered freer than those arising from domestic legislation, this concept seems to be increasingly more distant. A little because of the various regulations and a little because some agents consider that the BCRA is also operating so that the GD30 MEP dollar does not soar.\par \par \uc2 "The BCRA \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in global bonds over the close to accommodate the values," wrote in his networks the director of the consultancy Ledesma, Gabriel Caama\u241\'00\'F1o G\u243\'00\'F3mez.\par \par \uc2 And he added: "Yes, you read that right. They are originating, leveraging and providing the hedging demand in all segments that are creating and encepando more than a year ago".\par \par \uc2 Turning to the most well-known and recognized \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , i.e. the dollar \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  obtained by buying and selling the most popular local law bond (the AL30), a recent report by 1816 Consultancy highlighted: "The traded volume of AL30 against MEP and against pesos rose sharply again, suggesting that the Central was selling again close to u$s 30 million a day".\par \par \uc2 In its analysis, 1816 adds: "The AL30 against MEP traded in the last 3 days more than u$s 40m per screen in ByMA (taking all settlement terms), while the volume of AL30 against pesos in t+2 reached on Thursday the third highest level ever".\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Gabriel Rubinstein y Asociados Consultancy highlighted in its \uc2 Twitter\uc2  account: "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , counting all bonds, is already close to u$s 40 million per day".\par \par \uc2 The truth is that the AL30 MEP dollar, which is usually accessed by retailers, starts this week at $ 181.26, despite the battery of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It is far away from the official wholesale rate, which is at $ 99.94 pesos.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the so much mentioned blue goes to the field this Monday with a value of $ 199, after touching the dreaded 200 pesos on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The exchange pressures can be measured in different ways and all of them show that the market is very concerned about hedging in dollars against what happens with the pesos. For example, the dollar linked bond TV22 starts this Monday with an internal rate of return of -14.64 percent.\par \par \uc2 Another symptomatic data comes from the futures market and is described as follows by Andres Reschini, from F2 Soluciones Financieras: "In the week implicit rates in Rofex rose 408 basis points of average annual effective rate (TEA) and since the PASO accumulate 2319 basis points on average. As of April and March 2022 they exceed 76% AER. Open interest reached u$s 5156 million and is the highest of the year. Fears of a devaluation of the official exchange rate are growing".\par \par \uc2 What Guzm\u225\'00\'E1n said about the official \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in stock market dollars.\par \par \uc2 The Minister of Economy, \uc2 Mart\u237\'00\'EDn Guzm\u225\'00\'E1n\uc2 , gave an interview this weekend to the TV show Periodismo Puro, hosted by Jorge Fontevecchia on NetTV.\par \par \uc2 When asked about the BCRA's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in stock market dollars, Guzm\u225\'00\'E1n said: "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  seeks to maintain financial and exchange rate stability conditions that contribute to macroeconomic stability. It perceives these conditions to be able to lower inflation. Exchange rate stability is important and today, with capital controls. The stability of the gap is also important. There is a situation in which a purchase of government securities in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the prices they exhibit today, clearly implies a deleveraging of the consolidated public sector for the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  debt".\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020211107ehb70070v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
