\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Argentine  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  buys dollars for grain liquidation and low demand from importers: operators\b0\par\par\uc2 144 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Juli 2021\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES, July 2 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday had a strong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by buying some $200 million for its reserves in the face of a heavy liquidation of grain exporters and a low share of importers in the market, traders said.\par \par \uc2 They added that it was one of the largest official participations in the year for a single day.\par \par \uc2 The monetary institution regulates the liquidity of the market on a daily basis to sustain a very slight fall in the wholesale peso, which has devalued just over 12% in 2021, against inflation that is around 20% in the same period.\par \par \uc2 The BCRA has acquired some $725 million in June, when cereal exporters liquidated $3,358.4 million.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Jorge Otaola: Edited by Nicol\u225\'00\'E1s Misculin)\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020210702eh7200a3j\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (argentina near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury minist